{
    "word": "abuzz",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "cb0c64f3-c682-3d6f-ab5a-1d45dacb15d3",
                "word": "abuzz",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "75eb5838-8b43-4222-8da3-cba32698a069",
                        "entry_id": "cb0c64f3-c682-3d6f-ab5a-1d45dacb15d3",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more abuzz"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "986c0f98-15f6-4b7a-b8f3-83d587a68188",
                        "entry_id": "cb0c64f3-c682-3d6f-ab5a-1d45dacb15d3",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most abuzz"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
                        "entry_id": "cb0c64f3-c682-3d6f-ab5a-1d45dacb15d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characterized by a high level of activity or gossip; in a buzz (“feeling or rush of energy or excitement”), buzzing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "postpositional"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c6a3398-aa1b-475c-ab07-e71a6ef9bca4",
                                "sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
                                "text": "The court was all astir and a-buzz, when the black sheep—whom many fell away from in dread—pressed him into an obscure corner among the crowd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a82a6c0c-4ea8-47ce-a5e4-a130a77b545d",
                                "sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
                                "text": "There's too many women in the house for me: I hate the sound of women's voices; they're always either a-buzz or a-squeak, always either a-buzz or a-squeak."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf2785a9-8dec-4aa8-aa6c-bdf6c49650f4",
                                "sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
                                "text": "The long silent halls of sumptuous hotels are all abuzz with excited arrivals."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9eb6e3b-c454-4f7f-9995-1dee3d1ae506",
                                "sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
                                "text": "Now what a-devil has set this hornet's nest of theirs abuzz so suddenly?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8875d16-f4db-4388-8150-24ad5593a841",
                                "sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
                                "text": "The town was abuzz with excitement for an hour, when the news became stale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7a6e4b8-c2f1-4c61-ab0b-9e1fdf320308",
                                "sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
                                "text": "It was coming up on the cusp of July and August, and he remembered boyhood summers on the mountain's slopes abuzz with blackflies and syrupy heat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5299a70-27ef-4c2c-9036-9150a77a5cb1",
                                "sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
                                "text": "The ranch was abuzz with activity and had been for hours."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f118d0fc-1598-42fc-8953-9b57999dcdf5",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb0c64f3-c682-3d6f-ab5a-1d45dacb15d3",
                        "source_sense_id": "6279108a-abd1-378e-a6c5-5ba0da6141a3",
